From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 04:38:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 12/33] plugin: add manager support

Add PluginManager as the coordination point for the logging plugin
framework.

The manager owns the plugin registry, initializes builtin plugin
registrations, and creates runtime plugin instances from plugin
descriptors.

At runtime, PluginManager uses PluginRegistry to locate the factory
associated with a descriptor and delegates plugin construction to
the corresponding PluginFactory implementation.

Centralizing plugin-related operations behind a common interface
isolates callers from registry, factory, and plugin implementation
details.

Add unit tests covering plugin creation using registered factories.
Update Meson build files to build the manager tests.

No functional changes are intended.

Change-Id: Ic87b3c48617e5773c49280c319295d5719769237
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
